  "spec_html": "<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">醋酸丁酸纖維素<span lang=\"EN-US\"> CAB-381-0.5</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">    </span></span><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">醋酸丁酸纖維素<span lang=\"EN-US\"> CAB-381-0.5</span>作為高性能改性劑，在汽車塗料中顯著提升金屬顏料的定向排列效率與塗層快乾性，於工業防腐領域則有效平衡環氧樹脂體系的柔韌性與防腐耐久度；同時該成分在塑膠塗料中強化對<span lang=\"EN-US\"> ABS/PP </span>基材的附著力及耐化性，在高速印刷油墨中確保低黏度快乾與抗紫外線黃變特性，並延伸至木器漆應用以優化透明底漆的打磨效率與表面平整度，成為多領域塗裝工藝中兼顧效率與性能的通用解決方案。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">〔主要功能〕</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">I.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">快速溶劑釋放、縮短乾燥時間</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">減少烘烤設備占用時間，降低能耗，同時允許更早覆蓋下一層。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">減少厚塗時的垂直面流掛風險。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">C.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">減少層間互相溶解所造成的表面缺陷，尤其兩層以上覆蓋時。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">II.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">提升表面光澤度</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">促進金屬顏料定向排列，增加金屬顏料<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>如鋁粉<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>的閃光效果。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">其兩親性結構，可同時潤濕樹脂與顏料，有效微孔填充，減少光學散射。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">III.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">   </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">提升透明度</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">含微量的羟基能與樹脂相容性好，整體透明度保留度高。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">其張力穩定、流平性佳，能發揮本身較低的折射率，提高光學清晰度。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">IV.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">  </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">增加體系黏度</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">能形成三維輕網狀結構，可使流動性下降、黏度上升。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">在良好的溶劑中會展開並佔據較大體積，增加體系阻力，進一步提高黏度。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">V.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">成膜性極佳且堅硬、耐熱、抗刮擦</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">較高的<span lang=\"EN-US\">TG</span>能在戶外較熱時，也能維持較高的剛性，不易刮傷或變形。同時也能抵抗高溫時所引發的軟化或回黏。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 新細明體;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">長鏈分子更易形成互鎖與交纏的物理交聯結構，提升膜的強度與剛性。</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '新細明體',serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"mso-special-character: line-break; page-break-before: always;\"/> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">〔基本參數〕</span></strong></p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"margin-left: 4.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">玻璃轉移溫度<span lang=\"EN-US\">TG</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">130°C</span></p>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"5\" style=\"width: 139.5pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">溶解比例：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br/> </span>纖維素酯<span lang=\"EN-US\">-20%<br/> </span>丙酮或乙酸乙酯<span lang=\"EN-US\">-80<strong>%</strong></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">分子量</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">30000</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">羟基含量<span lang=\"EN-US\">(wt%)</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">1.3</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">乙酰基含量<span lang=\"EN-US\">(wt%)</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">13.83</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">丁酰基含量<span lang=\"EN-US\">(wt%)</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 139.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"186\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">36.72</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">** </span><span style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">以上參數由原廠提供 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: '新細明體',serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: '新細明體',serif;\">〔樹酯相容性〕</span></strong></p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"margin-left: 4.0pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-bo